      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Cancelling my VRC+. Their response to their own survey was terrible. They actually want to label things as human created content because they think people will try to sneak around having to use the AI label? Of course they will, but the same people will also misuse the label for human created content.\n\nVRC -- please get over yourselves and read the room. Your community wants AI disclosure.",
